OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVery strong and disruptive
OL,6,Fwinds continue throughout today, but
OL,7,Fstrongest during the morning,
OL,8,Fespecially for hills and coasts.
OL,9,FMostly cloudy with some bright or
OL,10,Fsunny spells but feeling cold in the
OL,11,Fwind. Scattered showers, mainly over
OL,12,Fnorthern hills.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FFeeling cold as strong winds
OL,15,Fand showers persist this evening.
OL,16,FThese will ease through the night and
OL,17,Fit will feel chilly under clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
