OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFeeling unpleasant through the
OL,6,Fday with persistent rain and
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds. Rain will be
OL,8,Fheaviest during the afternoon, then it
OL,9,Fwill ease for a time in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOn
OL,12,FTuesday, very strong winds, coastal
OL,13,Fgales and scattered showers. The
OL,14,Fshowers and strong winds will ease
OL,15,Finto Wednesday for a bright, breezy
OL,16,Fday. Fine on Thursday with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
